      "sourceTextSha256": "2fd900e4e232b630658b251cf9fdb134ebe0ea03c5932e253d1b7c165b34bed2",
      "text": "Day 11 · Transfer to the Bolivian border and start of the 4x4 jeep tour through landscapes of indescribable beauty: Laguna Verde beneath the Licancabur volcano, the Dalí Desert with its monumental rock sculptures, the Polques hot springs and the active Sol de Mañana geysers, with bubbling mud pools before your eyes. Next comes Laguna Colorada, a red lake at more than 4,200 metres, home to the rare James’s flamingo. Overnight in an expedition-style desert hotel.",
